  "title": "Tizeti Launches AI Powered Customer Experience: New and Awesome Deal",
  "summary": "Lagos, Nigeria – September 24, 2025 – Tizeti Network Limited, West Africa’s pioneering solar-powered internet provider, has announced the launch of its New & Awesome (NA) Deal, an Artificial Intelligence (AI)-powered overhaul of its customer experience designed to simplify issue resolution, streamline onboarding, and make payments frictionless for millions of users. The rollout begins October 1 for its fiber (FreeFiber.Africa) […]",
